WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.460
Around the year 1600, a new
plant reached Muslim lands.

2
00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:05.690
Tobacco.

3
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:07.850
No verse of the Qur'an names it.

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.490
No saying of the Prophet names it either.

5
00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.690
The Qur'an does name
intoxicants and gambling,

6
00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.010
and calls them an abomination.

7
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:16.990
Heroin.

8
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.100
Bank interest.

9
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.360
A cigarette.

10
00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.540
None of them is named anywhere.

11
00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:24.480
So who decides whether
the ban reaches them?

12
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:28.860
In this mission, you'll see how an
old ruling is stretched to a new case,

13
00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:30.500
one step at a time.

14
00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:35.880
Then you'll follow tobacco's story, from
early dispute to a growing consensus.

15
00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:40.830
Your mission: find out who decides
what the ban on wine covers, and how.
